  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "新作テレビアニメ『魔神創造伝ワタル』制作決定！主人公「星部ワタル」とともに冒険する「御富良院(おふらいん)」の魔神「風神丸」！",
      "en": "Production of the new TV anime “Mashin Souzouden Wataru” has been decided! Fujinmaru, the demon god of Ofurain, goes on an adventure with the main character, Wataru Hoshibe!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 部位ごとにパーツを分けられるシリーズ共通フレームを採用。他の魔神と組み合わせて遊ぼう！",
      "en": "• Adopts a common frame across the series that allows parts to be separated by area. Let's play in combination with other genies!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• パチパチと手で外せるタッチゲート仕様。接着剤無しで組み立てられる！",
      "en": "• Touch gate design that can be removed by hand. Can be assembled without adhesive!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 刀は鞘へ収納が可能。鞘は背面に取り付けができる。",
      "en": "• The sword can be stored in the scabbard. The scabbard can be attached to the back."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 頭部などはメタリックなゴールド成形色で再現。",
      "en": "• The head and other parts are reproduced in metallic gold molding color."
    }
  ],
